READ. F = 1 is Poisson. Falling F with growing H is the
sub-Poisson regime Goldston-Montgomery ties to the zeros' pair
correlation — the statistic entry 103 measured spectrally. The
dyadic table's blocks sit at the far end of this curve, which is
what O63's depth profile was seeing through the difference table.

